# {{ title }}

Each heading is a column and each task item is a card. Indented lines are the card's body. Drag cards in the preview, or focus one and press :kbd[Alt+Arrow] keys to move it. Double-click a card's title to rename it, and use the box at the bottom of a column to add a card. In tools that don't know `kanban`, the board shows as ordinary headings and task lists.

:::kanban {title="Sprint 12"}
